From: jayweihung <3034830+jayweihung@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 21:38:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] feat: drop at a place in a space's group; reorder agents
 by dragging

In the agents panel grouped by space, every agent row under a space's
header takes a mod's drag too, and a line shows where it lands: the
header is first, a row is right after its tab. dropOnSpace takes that
place and nextDrop() gives it as `index` (before that tab position,
1 = first; null on the spaces panel). A row also drags to another place
in its own group, which moves its tab (tab.move); the other spaces
refuse that drag.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
